<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan auctions 8.97 bln rupees six-month bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan auctions 8.97 bln rupees six-month bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had auctioned six-month maturity short-term federal bonds worth a total of 8.97 billion rupees in an open market operation on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said bids worth 5.32 billion rupees were accepted for the five-month repo at 14.80 percent.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
